# stress_pos10_0722.uci — SOLO loop of the trigger position (5/28 Alekhine,
# the twice-hanger). Same conditions as its slot in stress_qs_0717.uci
# (ucinewgame first = identical software state every iteration; only physical
# timing varies). ~2-4 min/iteration vs ~35 min/full pass = ~10x trigger
# exposure per hour. Run via stress-loop.sh, which stops + bells on a hang
# so the CPU stays frozen for the SC0 logic-probe read.
# On hang: (1) SC0 probe FIRST: pulsing = spinning, flat = halted.
# (2) EF4 button (for the record). (3) Warm reset -> dump $7E00-$7FFF FIRST
# (monitor tramples the stack top), then $6400-$64FF, then $641D decode.
ucinewgame
position startpos moves e2e4 g8f6 e4e5 f6e4 d2d3 e4f2 e1f2 b8c6 g1f3 c6e5 f3e5 d7d6 e5f7 e8f7 b1d2 e7e5 d1e1 d6d5 e1e5 f8c5 f2e1 h8e8 d2f3 e8e5 f3e5 f7e8 c2c4 d8e7 c1f4 d5c4 f4g3 c8d7 d3c4 d7f5 a1d1 a8d8
go depth 5
